STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260807T231514Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260807T231514Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Social Events
UID:event_316634847@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045649Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260927T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260927T170000
SUMMARY:Toronto Language Exchange | Practice Spanish & English (In-Person)
DESCRIPTION:Language Exchange Toronto - Se Habla English & Spanish\nJoin o
 ur **Spanish–English Language Exchange Meetup** and improve your convers
 ation skills in a relaxed\, social environment. This free event is perfect
  for anyone looking to practice Spanish or English while meeting new peopl
 e in a cozy coffee shop setting.\n\n### **🗣️ What You’ll Do**\n\n* 
 Practice Spanish and English through real conversations\n* Join small grou
 ps and switch languages throughout the event\n* Learn practical vocabulary
  and everyday expressions\n* Build confidence speaking in a supportive env
 ironment\n\n### **👥 Who Should Attend**\n\n* Spanish learners (all leve
 ls)\n* English learners (all levels)\n* Native speakers who want to help o
 thers\n* Anyone interested in language exchange and cultural connection\n\
 n### **☕ Venue**\n\nWe meet at a local coffee shop—just grab a drink a
 nd enjoy the conversation!\n\n### **💸 Cost**\n\n**FREE event** (please 
 support the venue by purchasing a drink)\n\n### **🌟 Why Join?**\n\nLang
 uage exchanges are one of the most effective ways to learn. You’ll impro
 ve faster by speaking with real people\, hearing authentic accents\, and u
 sing the language in everyday situations.\nWhether you're a beginner or fl
 uent speaker\, you’ll find a welcoming community ready to practice and c
 onnect.\n\n**👉 RSVP now and start speaking with confidence!**
